  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Process Heating, through WorleyParsons Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for Colombian energy utility Promigas Sociedade Annima (Promigas) to assess solar process heating systems. This feasibility study will help Promigas determine the viability of deploying concentrating solar technologies at commercial and industrial facilities in Colombia to reduce the energy costs associated with process heating systems.</narrative>
  </description>
